;
; Theorems about the kernel's type checker, bootstrap/check.geb, checked by
; bootstrap/metalogic/prove.geb against the prelude's, the reader's and the checker's
; definitions.

; a quoted tree has the type of trees, in every context and every environment
(theorem typeQuote ((G Ts) (ctx Ts) (x T)) (typeIn G ctx (node 15 (single x))) (some 0)
  (simp (unfold typeIn checkNode rrTrees single some none) (rw labelNode childrenNode arityDef)))
